menu "Motion Planner"

config PLANNER_SELF_TEST
    bool "Run motion planner self-test on boot"
    default n
    help
        Runs all 21 planner self-tests during startup (after the step
        engine self-test, before TMC2209 init).  At that point the
        TMC2209 EN pin is still high, so the motor does not turn —
        only STEP/DIR levels are driven.

        Results are printed via ESP_LOG; the final line is
        "SELF-TEST DONE: <n>/21 PASS".

        For on-target verification only.  Keep disabled in production.

endmenu
